  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Soil 400 CONTINUED STATUS\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #9886-A and Document #9886-B, effective 3-11-11, readopted with amendments Chapters Soil 300 and Soil 400. Document #9886-A also readopted with amendments Chapter Soil 500. The amendments in Document #9886-A included the adoption of a new Part Soil 402, and Document #9886-A and Document #9886-B also renumbered rules within Chapter Soil 400, as follows:\n\nFormer Rule New Rule",
